54915613", "author": {"steamid": "76561198144504000", "personaname": "Salado", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198144504000/", "num_games_owned": 308, "num_reviews": 73, "playtime_forever": 2884, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1038, "last_played": 1756866850, "avatar": "3eeb0ae06eae214eb6aeaf2a14996c5cf16488c9"}, "language": "english", "review": "AAAAAAAA I HATE ANTS I HATE ANTS I HATE ANTS!!!\n\nTHEY ARE EVERYWHERE, WE HAVE TO BURN THEM ALL!!!!", "timestamp_created": 1704046863, "timestamp_updated": 1704046863, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "154877283", "author": {"steamid": "76561197981584030", "personaname": "Celendrin", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197981584030/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 94, "playtime_forever": 4656, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1663, "last_played": 1758698194, "avatar": "b4992b9879babf1bcc5e05c2ad218b8067b68735"}, "language": "english", "review": "Are you kidding ?\n\n Pretty much wipes the floor with 99.9% of all games ever released,\n\n 100X better than 4.1 and 4.1 is an amazing game in itself,\n\n \n this review will be miles long if every little thing is pointed out about what makes it so good,\n\n just save yourself the trouble of debating and buy it,\n\n and yes, it goes on sale for 20 bucks once in a while.\n\n \n Even at 60 dollars it's worth 10000X more than almost any other game made in the last 20 years.\n\n\n (Also, the 'dumb story' people think is a joke and don't take seriously - is actually a highly profound metaphor of real life and an exact snapshot of Earth now as we know it, \n\n it's one of the best written most profound symbolic representations of what 'humanity faces' ever put in a game,\n\n cause it does it 'real time' with guns blazing - and still gets the point across.)\n\n \n If you don't know who the 'monsters' are - read some Dante,\n\n if you don't know who the 'Aliens' are - read some Shakespeare\n\n (and yes, the ''Aliens\" are so good at their job and 'controlling' \"monsters\" that they've already made sure their tracks are covered, they're great at blending in and appearing 'human'.. lol.. )\n\n that's the point - the game's giving deep truths in a way that nobody can censor,\n\n but are deep truths and relevant facts.. )\n\n\n (Please note I have nothing against 'Aliens' or otherwise, just pointing out how great the game is in how it gets it's point across)", "timestamp_created": 1704009294, "timestamp_updated": 1704010755, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 18, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.623410463333129883", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 13, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "154854469", "author": {"steamid": "76561198063727114", "personaname": "Synbi0s", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198063727114/", "num_games_owned": 227, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 34682, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 21314, "last_played": 1774100270, "avatar": "837e8bb98bb1d9408c093eae6e4db896ded08226"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the best co-op experiences I've ever had. It's also great solo.", "timestamp_created": 1703984402, "timestamp_updated": 1703984402, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded":